# Android Google Maps key — gitignored, never commit real keys.
# Create a key restricted to Android (package com.tuma.tuma_app + your
# debug keystore SHA-1) with "Maps SDK for Android" enabled, then:
#   MAPS_API_KEY=AIza...your Android maps key...
# and run ./run.sh mobile — the build injects it into the manifest.
# MAPS_API_KEY=
